      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/b77776/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-09-04T21:53:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>OK, I know how to run out of Attack +1/-1 tokens now. &nbsp;Use Visionary and Legacy on Citizen Dawn Scenario 1. &nbsp;Between Obilivion Shard handing out +1's, and Visionary handing out -1's en masse, poor Legacy didn't get to claim any with his Surge of Strength in the later rounds.</p>",
