      "created_at": "2014-09-05T10:47:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m not sure I buy the +1/-1 counters “running out” partly because it’s really dumb. The impaling structures are a specific power that makes sense to have some limitation, the attack and defence tokens are basically just tracking game effects, which shouldn’t just stop because someone else has hogged all the tokens.</p>",
