      "created_at": "2014-09-05T14:35:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't see why someone would build up hat many tokens. &nbsp;It has yet to be a problem for me.</p><p>&nbsp;Plus I think running out of tokens is a pos &nbsp;itive, it takes away the worst playstyle which is everyone sitting around stocking tokens while the game sucks.</p><p>Go use your tokens.</p>",
