      "raw": "[quote=\"phantaskippy\"]\n\nPlus I think running out of tokens is a pos &nbsp;itive, it takes away the worst playstyle which is everyone sitting around stocking tokens while the game sucks.\n\nGo use your tokens.\n\n[/quote]\nYeah, this is definitely something that comes up in the demos - folks just play too conservatively, which causes the game to drag out.\n",
